            <li><a href="#reading-figures">How to Read a Sunny Specification Sheet</a></li>
            <li><a href="#warranty-returns">Sunny’s Warranty and Return Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="#pads-manual">Sunny Walking Pads and Manual Treadmills</a></li>
            <li><a href="#safety">Recalls and Safety</a></li>
            <li><a href="#who-should-buy">Who Should Buy a Sunny Treadmill, and the Alternatives</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
